Package: librog-dovi-map1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libplacebo-rog387 (>= 1.0.0+private20261108-3), rog-dv-hevc-runtime (>= 2)
Description: Per-picture Dolby Vision mapping core
 The project's one owner of the Dolby Vision qualification and mapping
 rules, with a plain C ABI and no GLib or GStreamer dependency. The GTK
 video element and Firefox both call it. Requires the separately
 distributed private mapping provider.

