Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: librog-dovi-map1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for the Dolby Vision mapping core
 Public header and pkg-config metadata, without private mapping code.
